  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Addendum 3-&lt;p&gt;The contract foresees the supply, equipment design, manufacture, delivery, including any documentation required, certification, acceptance tests, the installation and licensing, commissioning, after-sales services, maintenance support, and training of the equipment for a facility to allow the release of the contaminated scrap metal - and other materials - from regulatory control&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
